### 상품 전체 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 상품 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 상품 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "게이밍 헤드셋",
  "price": 89000,
  "stock": 5
}

### 재고 감소 — 정상
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/1/decrease-stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 2
}

### 재고 감소 — 수량이 0 이하 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/1/decrease-stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 0
}

### 재고 감소 — 재고 부족 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/2/decrease-stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 999
}

### 재고 감소 — 판매중지 상품 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/4/decrease-stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1
}

### 한정판(재고 1개) 재고 소진 → SOLD_OUT 전환 확인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/3/decrease-stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1
}
